{"abstract":"The mental health needs of people affected by humanitarian crisis are significant but may be overlooked by healthcare providers. This paper reports on a 3-month, mixed method, field trial of a digital screening tool to identify people suffering mental health issues in Kutupalong refugee camp in Bangladesh. First, findings show that of 958 persons screened 20.46% exhibited indications of significant mental health issues. Second, ethnographic enquiries provide insights into the stressors of camp life, including, socio-spatial confinement, idleness, break-up of families, domestic disputes and uncertain prospects for the future, which in combination may explain the outcome of the screenings. The paper adds to the body of research on mental health in humanitarian crisis, and seeks to demonstrate the value of combining quantitative and qualitative data and analysis.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Christensen, Lars Rune","Ahsan, Hasib","Mandal, Subrata Kumar"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-383432"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, South"],"country":["Bangladesh"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Friendship"],"keyword":["Digital health care","Digital transformation","Global South","ICT for Development","Refugee","Rohingya","mHealth"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"rohingya mhealth investigating mental health in kutupalong refugee camp","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-SA","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.4103/INTV.INTV_10_20","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-383432","identifier":[{"id":"85097404038","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-9349af27-a2cc-48d6-9da0-f57ac3da938a"],"keyword":["Digital health care","Global South","ICT for Development","Refugee","Rohingya","digital transformation","mHealth"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-BFB2F2AAE05559BBA27FBF8A009AF16C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-SA","type":"rem","url":"https://www.interventionjournal.org/article.asp?issn=1571-8883;year=2020;volume=18;issue=2;spage=99;epage=107;aulast=Christensen","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.interventionjournal.org/temp/Intervention18299-4918874_133948.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-SA","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.4103/INTV.INTV_10_20","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-SA","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/85682941/Intervention.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Technologies in Practice, Technologies in Practice"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"bd","key":"friendship","loc":["Bangladesh","Asia, South"],"name":"Friendship","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars Rune","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"92f6c3f3-0ad2-40fc-b278-69170f87567d","name":"Christensen, Lars Rune","orcid":"0000-0001-7204-465X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hasib","key":"ahsanpau","last":"Ahsan","locid":"0bdda5a8-b38a-4532-b9a2-e5d9a98c05a7","name":"Ahsan, Hasib","orcid":"0000-0002-7812-2652","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Subrata Kumar","key":"mandalpau","last":"Mandal","name":"Mandal, Subrata Kumar","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.4103/intv.intv_10_20","issn":["18721001"],"issue":"2","journal":"Intervention Journal of Mental Health and Psychosocial Support in Conflict Affected Areas","pages":"99","publisher":"Wolters Kluwer","status":"p","title":"Intervention Journal of Mental Health and Psychosocial Support in Conflict Affected Areas","volume":"18"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85097404038"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-9349af27-a2cc-48d6-9da0-f57ac3da938a"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Rohingya mHealth: Investigating Mental Health in Kutupalong Refugee Camp","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-383432","year":"2020","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Based on fieldwork, we investigate the integration of an agricultural information service into a rural community in Bangladesh. We find that it takes work beyond the initial design and cursory introduction of the service to make the service work in a low-income rural community: it takes the strength of the farmers self-help groups to circulate the messages by word-of-mouth, it takes posters placed at key junctions according to a socio-geographic understanding of the village manifest in a map, and it (ideally) involves the support of the elite of the community via the broadcast of messages at places of high symbolic value. It takes all this in addition to a well-made information service delivering relevant and timely messages on for example agricultural matters. Hence, reducing the issue to one of technical delivery mechanism does not tell the full story.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Christensen, Lars Rune","Ahsan, Hasib","Rashid, Mamunur","Das, Badal Kumar"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-383310"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, South","Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Bangladesh","Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Chattogram Medical University","Welthungerhilf","mPower Social Enterprises Ltd"],"keyword":["Agricultural Information Service","Information Dissemination","Rural Community Integration","Self Help Groups","Socio Geographic Mapping"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"are you magicians the collaborative work of an agricultural information service","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3287098.3287109","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-383310","identifier":[{"id":"85060946437","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-8b74c168-c939-4144-880b-073113476d4d"],"keyword":["Agricultural Information Service","Information Dissemination","Rural Community Integration","Self-Help Groups","Socio-Geographic Mapping"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-1C8244EF66812030E99F5C0065F8046B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3287098.3287109","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Technologies in Practice, Technologies in Practice"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"bd","key":"mpower social enterprises ltd","loc":["Bangladesh","Asia, South"],"name":"mPower Social Enterprises Ltd","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"bd","key":"chattogram medical university","loc":["Bangladesh","Asia, South"],"name":"Chattogram Medical University","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"de","key":"welthungerhilf","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Welthungerhilf","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars Rune","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"92f6c3f3-0ad2-40fc-b278-69170f87567d","name":"Christensen, Lars Rune","orcid":"0000-0001-7204-465X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Hasib","key":"ahsanpau","last":"Ahsan","name":"Ahsan, Hasib","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Mamunur","key":"rashidpau","last":"Rashid","name":"Rashid, Mamunur","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Badal Kumar","key":"daspau","last":"Das","name":"Das, Badal Kumar","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3287098.3287109","pages":"1-10","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery","status":"p","title":"ICTD '19: Proceedings of the Tenth International Conference on Information and Communication Technologies and Development"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85060946437"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-8b74c168-c939-4144-880b-073113476d4d"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Are You Magicians? The Collaborative Work of an Agricultural Information Service","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-383310","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Accounting for the ways in which ICT initiatives are worked into local communities is part of rendering “the local perspectives” within ICT4D. This paper is part of that. Based on in-depth fieldwork, we investigate the integration of an agricultural information service into a rural community in Bangladesh. We find that it takes work beyond the initial design and cursory introduction of the service to make the service work in a low-income rural community: it takes the strength of the farmers self-help groups to circulate the messages by word-of-mouth, it takes posters placed at key junctions according to a socio-geographic understanding of the village manifest in a map, and it (ideally) involves the support of the elite of the community via the broadcast of messages at places of high symbolic value. It takes all this in addition to a well-made information service delivering relevant and timely messages on for example agricultural matters. Hence, reducing the issue to one of technical delivery mechanism does not tell the full story.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Christensen, Lars Rune","Ahsan, Hasib","Rashid, Mamunur","Das, Badal Kumar"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-701226"],"event":{"acronym":"IFIP 9.4","title":"International Conference on Social Implications of Computers in Developing Countries"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, South","Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Bangladesh","Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Welthungerhilf","mPower Social Enterprises Ltd"],"keyword":["Agricultural Information Services","Bangladesh","ICT4D","Local Perspectives","Rural Community Integration"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a local perspective working an agricultural information service into a rural community","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-19115-3_22","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-701226","identifier":[{"id":"85065709603","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-0841e9ba-6ba4-4c9e-a384-788bf914653a"],"keyword":["Agricultural Information Services","Bangladesh","ICT4D","Local Perspectives","Rural Community Integration"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-56294DA866009A5B3CA923614B1C1B08"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-19115-3_22","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Technologies in Practice, Technologies in Practice"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"welthungerhilf","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Welthungerhilf","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"bd","key":"mpower social enterprises ltd","loc":["Bangladesh","Asia, South"],"name":"mPower Social Enterprises Ltd","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars Rune","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"92f6c3f3-0ad2-40fc-b278-69170f87567d","name":"Christensen, Lars Rune","orcid":"0000-0001-7204-465X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hasib","key":"ahsanpau","last":"Ahsan","locid":"0bdda5a8-b38a-4532-b9a2-e5d9a98c05a7","name":"Ahsan, Hasib","orcid":"0000-0002-7812-2652","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Mamunur","key":"rashidpau","last":"Rashid","name":"Rashid, Mamunur","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Badal Kumar","key":"daspau","last":"Das","name":"Das, Badal Kumar","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-030-19115-3_22","isbn":["9783030191146","9783030191153"],"publisher":"Springer","status":"p","title":"Information and Communication Technologies for Development. Strengthening Southern-Driven Cooperation as a Catalyst for ICT4D"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85065709603"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-0841e9ba-6ba4-4c9e-a384-788bf914653a"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"A Local Perspective: Working an Agricultural Information Service into a Rural Community","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-701226","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"In this paper, we present Krishi Kontho (literally, “agricultural voices”), which is an agricultural information service that utilises pre-recorded voice messages, and SMS, that are pushed to smallholder farmers mobile phones at intervals carefully choreographed with the life cycles of their crops. We present the design of the service, and we present the result of an eleven-month field trial in rural Bangladesh. Findings indicate that this type of service, that synchronises messages with cultivation practice, may improve crop yields while reducing the use of agricultural inputs such as fertiliser and pesticides. We find that the farmers in the field trial deemed the service to be of value to them in regard to improving their agricultural practices. We conclude by discussing our findings and their implications for the design of agricultural information services, including the challenge of designing for specific temporalities, or rhythms of practice, in rural Bangladesh and elsewhere.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Christensen, Lars Rune","Ahsan, Hasib","Akand, Eshrat"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-382491"],"event":{"acronym":"NordiCHI","title":"Nordic Conference on Human-Computer Interaction"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Agricultural Information Service","Crop Lifecycle Synchronization","Field Trial in Rural Bangladesh","Pre recorded Voice Messages","Smallholder farmers"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"krishi kontho an agricultural information service in bangladesh","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3240167.3240225","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-382491","identifier":[{"id":"85056598524","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-51c273d8-fb0a-4236-8067-b7fd317b6846"],"keyword":["Agricultural Information Service","Crop Lifecycle Synchronization","Field Trial in Rural Bangladesh","Pre-recorded Voice Messages","Smallholder Farmers"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-0B3129D835E500509FE09C00559616DA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/83641722/NordiChi_Krishi_Kontho_v35_PURE.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3240167.3240225","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Center for Climate IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Digitalization, Democracy, and Governance, REFLACT","IT University of Copenhagen, Technologies in Practice, Technologies in Practice"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars Rune","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"92f6c3f3-0ad2-40fc-b278-69170f87567d","name":"Christensen, Lars Rune","orcid":"0000-0001-7204-465X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hasib","key":"ahsanpau","last":"Ahsan","locid":"0bdda5a8-b38a-4532-b9a2-e5d9a98c05a7","name":"Ahsan, Hasib","orcid":"0000-0002-7812-2652","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Eshrat","key":"akandpau","last":"Akand","name":"Akand, Eshrat","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3240167.3240225","isbn":["9781450364379"],"pages":"203-214","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery","status":"p","title":"NordiCHI '18 Proceedings of the 10th Nordic Conference on Human-Computer Interaction"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85056598524"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-51c273d8-fb0a-4236-8067-b7fd317b6846"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Krishi Kontho: An Agricultural Information Service in Bangladesh","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-382491","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"The GEOPOTATO project develops and implements a decision support service (DSS) in Bangladesh to control the late blight disease in potato. Satellite data and various models are important aspects of the DSS. GEOPOTATO aims at becoming the preferred agricultural advice service for potato farmers in Bangladesh.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Pronk, Annette","Ahsan, Hasib","Islam, Nazrul","Rahman, Md. Masudur","Kessel, Geert","Hengsdijk, Huib"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-712520"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, South","Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Bangladesh","Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Wageningen University & Research","mPower Social Enterprises Ltd"],"keyword":["Bangladesh","Digital agriculture","Precision agriculture","Remote sensing","geopotato"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"baseline study geopotato geopotatol report 000000000002","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://edepot.wur.nl/423050","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["G4AW program of the Dutch Ministry of Foreign Affairs, which is executed by the Netherlands Space Office (NSO)."],"id":"S01-000.00-712520","ids":["itu-4db5bf34-6d07-4478-bf22-6733676856f8"],"keyword":["Bangladesh","Precision agriculture","digital agriculture","geopotato","remote sensing"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-4D73F1A2756C2C1E1E016D78342D0D59"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://edepot.wur.nl/423050","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"nl","key":"wageningen university research","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Wageningen University & Research","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Center for Climate IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Business Innovation, Information Systems and Digital Innovation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"bd","key":"mpower social enterprises ltd","loc":["Bangladesh","Asia, South"],"name":"mPower Social Enterprises Ltd","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Annette","key":"pronkpau","last":"Pronk","name":"Pronk, Annette","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Hasib","key":"ahsanpau","last":"Ahsan","locid":"0bdda5a8-b38a-4532-b9a2-e5d9a98c05a7","name":"Ahsan, Hasib","orcid":"0000-0002-7812-2652","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Nazrul","key":"islampau","last":"Islam","name":"Islam, Nazrul","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Md. Masudur","key":"rahmanpau","last":"Rahman","name":"Rahman, Md. Masudur","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Geert","key":"kesselpau","last":"Kessel","name":"Kessel, Geert","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Huib","key":"hengsdijkpau","last":"Hengsdijk","name":"Hengsdijk, Huib","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"59","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-4db5bf34-6d07-4478-bf22-6733676856f8"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Baseline study GEOPOTATO : GEOPOTATOl Report 2","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-712520","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"GEOPOTATO is one of the projects funded within the Geodata for Agriculture and Water (G4AW) facility, which improves food security in developing countries by using satellite data. The Netherlands Space Office (NSO) is executing this programme, commissioned by the Dutch Ministry of Foreign Affairs. The GEOPOTATO project develops a decision‐support service (DSS) for farmers in Bangladesh for an optimal control strategy of the late blight disease in potato. Late blight (Phytophthora infestans) is a highly infectious and destructive fungal disease in Solanaceae crops, i.e. among others potatoes and tomatoes. The DSS is provided to farmers through SMS. The objective of the GEOPOTATO project is to reach 100,000 potato farmers with the DSS after three years. The GEOPOTATO project selected the major potato producing region Munshiganj as the region to pilot the service in the season 2016/2017. The introduction was accompanied with field demonstrations on the DSS. In this report, first findings of the introduction of the DSS in Munshiganj are evaluated and described, and compared with results of the baseline study in Munshiganj.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Pronk, Annette","Ahsan, Hasib","Rahman, Masudur","Kessel, Geert","Hengsdijk, Huib"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-776458"],"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Wageningen University & Research"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"geo data for late blight control in potato evaluation of decision support service in bangladesh 000000002016 000000002017","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-SA","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.18174/447206","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["Geodata for Agriculture and Water (G4AW), Netherlands Space Office (NSO)"],"id":"S01-000.00-776458","ids":["itu-f1bedf5d-3de8-46cb-bf90-99a6d140b535"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-73487C5BF53F3498194166886583B11C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-SA","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.18174/447206","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"nl","key":"wageningen university research","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Wageningen University & Research","used":1},{"affno":2,"key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU"}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Annette","key":"pronkpau","last":"Pronk","name":"Pronk, Annette","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Hasib","key":"ahsanpau","last":"Ahsan","locid":"0bdda5a8-b38a-4532-b9a2-e5d9a98c05a7","name":"Ahsan, Hasib","orcid":"0000-0002-7812-2652","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Masudur","key":"rahmanpau","last":"Rahman","name":"Rahman, Masudur","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Geert","key":"kesselpau","last":"Kessel","name":"Kessel, Geert","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Huib","key":"hengsdijkpau","last":"Hengsdijk","name":"Hengsdijk, Huib","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.18174/447206","series":"GEOPOTATO external report","status":"p","title":"Wageningen University and Research"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-f1bedf5d-3de8-46cb-bf90-99a6d140b535"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Geo data for late blight control in potato : evaluation of decision support service in Bangladesh, 2016‐2017","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-776458","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
